{
  "format": "delete-reservation-cases.v1",
  "about": "Shared by noevia-rs (model_delete reservation) and noevia-services (services.delete_reservation). Each case is a synthetic models folder (files, models-relative) and, for every model the listing shows there, the models-relative paths a delete of it reserves against new downloads (noevia#1972). The canonical copy is in noevia-rs; services keeps an identical copy, pinned by sha256 in its test. Refresh both together.",
